\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">예술경영지원센터는 국제문화교류의 지속적인 성장추세에 따라 현장이 필요로 하는 전문인력 양성을 위해 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국제문화교류 전문인력 양성사업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">’</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">을 시행하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이에 따라 재외 한국문화원에 파견</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">배치될 문화예술 예비인력</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">인턴</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) 11</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기를 공개 모집하오니 관심 있는 대학생 및 졸업생 여러분의 많은 참여와 관심 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">자세한 사항은 붙임 서류 확인바랍니다.</span></span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#ff007f\">* 1차 본교 접수 기간</font></strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#ff007f\">2016년 11월 21(월) 16:00 까지 국제교류교육원 T458호로 접수</font></strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">* 문의 : 국제교류교육원 054-478-7221 / <a href=\"mailto:sungmi@kumoh.ac.kr\">sungmi@kumoh.ac.kr</a></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMI